2:  Create a useful booking system for a gym that meets the customer's requirements.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
3: Product Backlog

3:1. [Schedule] As a gym member, I want to see the schedule with times, class types, and available places, so that I can see what time the classes are.

3:2. [Booking] As a gym member, I want to be able to book a class using the booking system, so that I can reserve a place digitally in advance.

3:3. [Cancellation] As a gym member, I want to be able to cancel a class up to 2 hours before it starts, so that I can cancel if my schedule changes and avoid a no-show.

3:4. [Waitlist] As a gym member, I want to be able to join a class waitlist if it is fully booked, so that I get a spot automatically if someone cancels.

3:5. [Mobile Optimization] As a gym member, I want the booking system to be usable on mobile devices, so that I can use my phone to book and view classes.

3:6. [Reminder] As a gym member, I want to get a reminder for my class a day before, so that I do not forget to attend.

3:7. [Attendee List] As an instructor, I want to be able to see the list of participants for my class, so that I know who is attending.

3:8. [Attendance Tracking] As an instructor, I want to mark who attended my class, so that I can keep track of class attendance.

3:9. [Create Class] As a reception staff member, I want to be able to add new classes, so that I can keep the class repertoire updated.

3:10. [Edit Class] As a reception staff member, I want to be able to change the time of a class, so that I can keep the class schedule updated.

